B. Software Module (Green Node Monitoring System)
25050819653300
Software Module (Green Node Monitoring System)
The Green Node Monitoring System supports four integrated supervision and control interfaces, providing authorized users and administrators with comprehensive access to monitor and manage environmental and operational conditions within data centers and smart facilities.
Monitoring & Control Interfaces
Mobile Application (Android & iOS)
SCADA Software (provided by Karno Company)
7-inch Touchscreen Panel, installable inside or outside the data center
Web-Based Application, enabling remote access and monitoring from any authorized computer via local network or the Internet
Alarm Management & Event Logging
The Green Node package is capable of generating a wide range of intelligent alarms. These alarms are delivered through visual indicators, audible alerts, the management software platform, and SMS notifications to system administrators.
All alarms and incidents are logged in structured event tables, ensuring full traceability, timestamping, and post-event analysis of all environmental and operational occurrences.
Supported Alarm Types
Water leakage detection
Fire alarm
Room door open status
Rack door open status
Unauthorized access detection (intrusion alarm)
Overcurrent detection per rack or UPS
Input voltage drop per rack or UPS
High temperature and/or humidity alarms
(Environmental temperature and humidity monitoring and control)
Features & Benefits
Monitoring and control via touchscreen panel
Monitoring and control via SMS-based system
Monitoring and control via desktop/system software
Monitoring and control via web-based platform (local or Internet access, configurable by system administrator)
Monitoring and control via mobile applications (Android & iOS)
