Parto Ertebat Saba, a knowledge-based company, has been active since 2008 in the design and manufacture of hardware and the development of software for telecommunications equipment and network security. The company’s mission is to provide solutions and to design and produce specialized products with high technical expertise to address communication network security challenges. With a team composed of PhD and master’s degree graduates from the country’s leading universities, Parto Ertebat Saba pursues the localization of essential equipment and strives to deliver optimal solutions to its customers with the highest technical performance in the shortest possible time. To achieve its vision and to foster synergy with other stakeholders, the company, over more than a decade of presence in the communications, network security, and information technology industries, has obtained membership in the Iran Telecommunications Industry Syndicate, the Iran Computer Trade Organization, and the Information Production and Exchange Space Security Association. Owing to its strong performance in this field, it has also obtained product approval certificates from the Radio Regulatory Authority, the Presidential Information Technology Security Management Center, qualification approval certificates from the Supreme Informatics Council and the Presidential Planning and Budget Organization, as well as approvals from the Iran Information Technology Organization and the Supplier Management System Steering Center (SAMTA), along with other required licenses for cooperation with all public and private sector organizations in the country.', 'مرتضی محمدپور، مهران سلمانی', 'Morteza Mohammadpour,
