  ('پیام گستر فاوا', 'karasite.ir', 'info@payamgostar.ir', '.PAYAM GOSTAR FAVA', 'تولید و عرضه انواع نرم افزار و سخت افزار', 'Production and distribution of various software and hardware solutions', 'شرکت دانش بنیان پیام گستر با مجوز تولید فناوری اطالعات از وزارت صنعت، معدن و تجارت و تجربه تخصصی در حوزه کنترل تردد و حفاظت فیزیکی، نرم افزار جامع حراست و انتظامات «دژبان» و ماژول های کاربردی آن را با بهره گیری از هوش مصنوعی و فناوری های مدرن ارائه می دهد. این سیستم امکاناتی مانند ثبت و رزرو تردد مراجعین، خودروها و کاالها، ثبت لوح نگهبانی، گزارشات شیفت و کنترل تردد پرسنل و پیمانکاران را فراهم می کند. پیام گستر عالوه بر ISO9001 اروپا، موفق به اخذ استانداردهایCE تولید انواع گیت های کنترل تردد با استاندارد شده است. همچنین این شرکت نرم افزارهای پخش مویرگی و حسابداری «کارا» وISO10002 و نرم افزار مدیریت ارتباط با مشتریان «سامان» را توسعه داده که در حوزه کافی شاپ، رستوران و .صنعت غذا کاربرد دارد', '(Maximum 300 words)
Payam Gostar Knowledge-Based Company, holding an official Information Technology production operation license from the Ministry of Industry, Mine, and Trade, leverages many years of experience and a specialized, process-oriented approach in the fields of access control and physical security. By employing skilled and experienced personnel, the company offers a comprehensive security and guard management software (Dezhban) along with its functional modules, utilizing artificial intelligence technologies and other highly practical and modern products to mechanize access control and security operations within organizations.
The Dezhban Integrated System provides a wide range of capabilities, including: reservation and registration of visitor access, vehicle access reservation and registration, goods entry and exit registration, freight vehicle traffic logging, guard logbook registration, shift reports and incident logs, personnel and contractor vehicle access control, along with dozens of other general and customized practical features.
As one of the manufacturers of various access control gates, the company is a member of the Supreme Council of Informatics of Iran and the Iran Computer Trade Organization, and has obtained the European CE standard for its access control gates. It has also successfully achieved Quality Management System (ISO 9001) and Customer Satisfaction Management (ISO 10002) certifications.
Additionally, the company has taken effective steps in this field by developing the Kara distribution and accounting software, which is capable of competing with other similar software solutions.
In the next phase, the company successfully developed and launched a Customer Relationship Management (CRM) software under the commercial name Saman. This software operates in the areas of performance management and customer relations, specifically targeting cafés, restaurants, and the food service industry.', 'حسین عابدین', 'Hosein Abedin', '. شرکت دانش بنیان است', '. The company is knowledge-based', 'سازمانیICT خدمات ارتباطی، راهکارهای', 'Organizational ICT communication services, solutions', 50, 10002),
