Company Overview
(Maximum 300 words)
With more than three decades of experience in the information technology industry, Green Web is recognized as one of the largest and most influential players in digital transformation and intelligent solutions in the country. By focusing on emerging technologies such as artificial intelligence, the Internet of Things (IoT), blockchain, cloud services, web hosting, and cybersecurity, Green Web has consistently supported its stakeholders, particularly private-sector businesses and industries.
In line with the development of the global technology market, Green Web has strengthened its international presence and, as an official IT export facilitator (under the Organization for Development of International Scientific and Technological Cooperation of the Vice Presidency for Science and Technology), has supported knowledge-based companies in entering global markets.
To date, Green Web has received numerous accolades, among which the most notable is being honored repeatedly as the “Only National Exemplary Exporter of the Information Technology Industry.” Another significant achievement is its admission to the capital market as Iran’s first artificial intelligence and cloud infrastructure company, paving the way for the expansion of activities and digital transformation of major industries.
