* تصاویر خواسته‌شده علاوه بر درج در فرم به‌صورت جداگانه، با کیفیت بالا و همراه با فرم تکمیل‌شده ارسال گردد.', 'The sonar data acquisition card consists of an Artix-7 series FPGA chip from Xilinx, the manufacturer and distributor of the clock pulse, and five 1G network ports. This card receives data from multiple sonar sampler cards via network ports and, after synchronizing and forming new frames, sends them to the computer.'),
