Workflow Standard: BPMN 2.0 (BPD)
Android Technologies:
Kotlin, Java
Kotlin Coroutines
Dagger2 (Dependency Injection)
NFC
Retrofit, Room ORM
LiveData, MVVM
Intent Services
ACRA Bug Reporting
Database: SQLite
Product Commercialization Status:
This product is currently deployed across more than 30 organizations in major industries, including power generation, steel, petrochemical, refining, gas, and oil sectors.'),
