* تصاویر خواسته‌شده علاوه بر درج در فرم به‌صورت جداگانه، با کیفیت بالا و همراه با فرم تکمیل‌شده ارسال گردد.', 'In many organizations, both small and large processes play a vital role as core, management, or support functions that directly impact business stability, growth, and long-term success. However, because business models are often uncertain, markets change rapidly, and many processes are highly specialized and unique to each organization’s structure and culture, these processes cannot be effectively automated using standard off-the-shelf software.
To address this challenge, organizations can rely on Pegahe Aftab’s Business Process Management Platform.
This platform equips business and process specialists with everything they need to create enterprise software solutions without unnecessary complexity. It allows users to define data structures, design intuitive and mobile-friendly forms and user interfaces, model and manage workflows, build applications with minimal coding, apply business rules and conditions, and generate reports, printable outputs, and management dashboards.
The platform is suitable for developing both process-based and non-process-based systems across all industries. It supports use cases ranging from transforming Excel files into simple applications to building mission-critical systems used daily by thousands of users.
Features and Advantages:
Organization and structure management
User, role, and access level management
Entity designer
Form designer
Business rules and validation rules designer
Calculation and expression designer
Report and user query designer
Chart designer
Dashboard designer
Word template management
Excel template management
Dynamic API management
Process workflow design and execution management
Menu designer
Help and documentation management
Message, notification, and action management
Unified (omni) search
Change history, views, and activity tracking
Lightweight and advanced profiling tools
Entity mapping
Business Activity Monitoring (BAM)
Integrated chatbot and LLM infrastructure with support for both offline and online AI models
