* تصاویر خواسته‌شده علاوه بر درج در فرم به‌صورت جداگانه، با کیفیت بالا و همراه با فرم تکمیل‌شده ارسال گردد.', 'Tarsim System, the main product of Tarsim Dataware Company, is a comprehensive, integrated and modular software that brings organizations to operational maturity by utilizing a team of experts in the development and analysis of industrial systems.
This system consists of eight main modules:
• Physical Asset Management (EAM)
• Maintenance and Repair Management (CMMS)
• Risk Management (RMS)
• Health, Safety and Environment Management (HSE)
• Process Safety Management (PSM)
• Virtual Learning (LMS)
• Centralized Document Management (DCC)
• Risk-Based Inspection Management (RBI)
In addition to the main modules, Tarsim System has advanced subsystems that provide management, analytical and intelligent capabilities to the organization. This integrated and flexible structure allows for the customization, localization and independent and integrated use of each module and its goal is to increase productivity, optimize resources and reduce the organization''s operating costs.
Features and Advantages:
Tarsim system as a comprehensive and integrated industrial software solution helps organizations in the complete management of processes, resources, data and decision-making and offers outstanding technical and functional capabilities, including the following.
• Complete integration between modules and subsystems
• Modularity and the ability to use each module independently
• Customization and localization capabilities according to the organization''s needs
• Multi-tenancy support
• Advanced process and workflow management (BPMS) with the ability to design fully dynamic data flows
• Business intelligence and data analysis (BI and 3DMS) for data-driven decision-making
• Big data integration and advanced processing
• Complete security features and access control at the module and subsystem level
• Technical document management with versioning and controlled access
• Powerful search engine and intelligent report generator
• Artificial intelligence support for data analysis and trend prediction
• Flexibility in displaying information fields and headers at different stages of the workflow
• Dynamic control of the effectiveness of modules and subsystems
• Ability to integrate with external systems and process data
Technical Specifications:
• Core components: WSO2, Spring Integration
• Component architecture style: Monolithic, Micro Service, SOA, Modular
• Programming language: JAVA
• Frontend framework: Isomorphic: Smart client, Vue.js
• Backend framework: Spring Framework
• Database: Oracle, Elastic
• Product deployment framework: Docker, VM, JAR/WAR
• Product deployment virtualization platform: Kubernetes, VMWare, Dedicated Server
• Operating system: Windows, Linux
Product Commercialization Status:
Tarsim System is a fully developed and operational software that has been used in various industries. This knowledge-based and native product with customization capabilities currently has numerous customers in the oil and gas, petrochemical, mining and other manufacturing industries and is known as a comprehensive industrial management solution.
Due to its high flexibility and the ability to develop new modules, the system is ready to respond to the diverse needs of different organizations and industries.'),
  ('ترسیم داده افزار', 'tarsimdade.com', 'tarsimdadeh@gmail.com', 'X_Stone خط تولید نرم افزاری', NULL, 'X_Stone software production line', 'به عنوان یک خط تولید نرم افزار دانش بنیان، راهکاریX-Stone سریع و بهینه برای توسعه نرم افزارهای مقیاس بزرگ ارائه می دهد و با بهره گیری از جدیدترین روش ها و فناوری های روز، بستری یکپارچه برای خلق محصوالت سطح باال فراهم می کند. این پلتفرم ، معماری سرویس گراModel-Driven Development با متدولوژی پیاده‌سازی شده و باJava/JEE ) و زبان برنامه نویسیSOA( امکان اتصال به تمامی پایگاه های دادهORM استفاده از قابلیت را فراهم می آورد. این زیرساخت با کاهش هزینه تولید و نگهداری نرم افزار، کاهش نیاز به نیروی انسانی، کاهش زمان پروژه و تسهیل آموزش افراد تازه وارد، بهره وری سازمان را افزایش می دهد. طراحی سیستم به صورت زیرسیستم های مستقل، مقیاس پذیری با پشتیبانی از تعدادX-Stone .باال و انعطاف پذیری در مواجهه با دامنه ها و پیچیدگی های مختلف را تضمین می کند نامحدود کاربر و حجم داده باال، حذف کارهای تکراری، تسریع توسعه با کدساز و یکپارچگی کد و فرم ها، کارایی و سرعت بهره برداری را افزایش می دهد. این پلتفرم با رمزنگاری قوی، مدیریت دسترسی کاربران فردی و گروهی و رعایت اصول برنامه نویسی امن، سطح باالیی از امنیت اطالعات را فراهم می کند و با کاهش ریسک فنی و منابع انسانی و امکان تولید ،ماژول های متنوع بدون وابستگی به تیم خارجی، یکپارچگی سیستم را تضمین می‌کند. رابط کاربری ساده و یکپارچه ،زمان یادگیری را کاهش داده و سرعت استفاده از سیستم را افزایش می دهد. معماری سرویس گرا، پایگاه داده قدرتمند را بهX-Stone ، و امکان بهره برداری در محیط ابری چنداجاره ایORM قابلیت مقیاس سازمانی، پشتیبانی از وب سرویس و .زیرساختی پیشرفته، منعطف و قابل اعتماد برای توسعه نرم افزارهای پیچیده تبدیل کرده است', 'As a knowledge-based software production line, X-Stone provides a fast and optimal solution for large-scale software development and provides an integrated platform for creating high-level products by using the latest methods and technologies. This platform, service-oriented architecture with Model-Driven Development methodology implemented and with Java/JEE (and SOA programming language) provides the possibility of connecting to all ORM databases. This infrastructure increases the productivity of the organization by reducing the cost of software production and maintenance, reducing the need for manpower, reducing project time and facilitating the training of newcomers. System design as independent subsystems, scalability with support for high X-Stone numbers and flexibility in facing the domain It guarantees unlimited users and high volume of data, accelerates development with code generator, and increases efficiency and speed of operation. This platform provides a high level of information security with strong encryption, individual and group access management, and the possibility of producing diverse modules without dependence on an external team. Simple and integrated user interface It reduces the learning time and increases the speed of using the system. The service-oriented architecture has turned the powerful database into X-Stone, and the possibility of operating in the multi-tenant cloud environment, the ability of enterprise scale, web service support, and an advanced, flexible and reliable infrastructure for the development of complex software.'),
