وضعیت تجاری‌سازی محصول', 'FarinFabric is an AInpowered DevSecOps platform designed to integrate deeply with GitLab CI/CD pipelines. It automatically analyzes source code during Merge Requests to identify security vulnerabilities, logical flaws, architectural risks, and documentation gaps before code reaches production.
Features and Advantages:
• AInbased security and logic analysis
• OWASP Top 10 and CWEnaligned vulnerability detection
• Automated technical documentation generation
• Merge Request comments and risk scoring
• Policynbased blocking and approval gates
• GitLab Security Dashboard (SARIF) compatibility
ContextnAware Code Intelligence
LLM + Static Analysis + Policy Engine
Business Benefits
• Reduce security incidents before production deployment
• Accelerate Merge Request reviews without sacrificing quality
• Enforce consistent DevSecOps policies across teams
• Improve compliance readiness for regulated environments
• Lower operational security costs through automation
Technical Specifications:
FarinFabric consists of a modular analysis fabric including:
• AI Analysis Layer (OpenAI / Azure OpenAI / OnnPrem LLM)
• Static Analysis Engines (Semgrep, Bandit, Trivy)
• Policy & Risk Scoring Engine
• Report Generator (Markdown, JSON, SARIF)
• GitLab Integration & CI Component Layer
