165109080500', 'InfraSense-M-S2-03 is a smart, modular, industrial multi-sensor interface designed for monitoring and managing environmental conditions in sensitive spaces such as data centers, server rooms, telecom facilities, industrial sites, and other critical infrastructures.
The device collects, analyzes, and transmits environmental data including temperature, humidity, liquid leakage, door status, and other critical parameters, enabling real-time monitoring and rapid response to abnormal conditions.
Unlike traditional rack-mounted controllers or BMS panels, InfraSense is a lightweight, cost-effective, and scalable solution that directly transmits sensor data to infrastructure management and monitoring systems via Modbus RTU, without the need for a dedicated central controller. Its compact modular design allows installation inside racks, cabinets, under racks, or confined spaces, without occupying valuable rack space.
Features and Advantages:
Functional Features
-Industrial multi-sensor interface for environmental monitoring
-Supports:Digital sensors
-Analog sensors
-Water leakage sensors
-1-Wire temperature & humidity sensors
-Simultaneous connection of:
-3 digital inputs
-1 analog input
-1 water leakage sensor
-Up to 6 temperature & humidity 1-Wire sensors
-Built-in temperature and humidity sensor
-Industrial communication via Modbus RTU
-Daisy-chain (Ring / Bus) connectivity for multiple modules
-Easy configuration using DIP switches
-Direct data transmission to BMS and DCIM systems
-No rack mounting or central controller required
Economic Benefits
-Significant reduction in cabling and installation costs
-Eliminates the need for BMS panels and standalone controllers
-Lower maintenance and operational costs
-Cost-effective solution for small to large data centers
Operational Benefits
-Fast and simple installation
-High scalability for large-scale projects
-Ability to monitor a large number of sensors over a single communication bus
-Rapid response to abnormal environmental changes
Technical & Management Benefits
-Fully compatible with existing monitoring software
-No rack space consumption
-High flexibility for adding or modifying sensors
-Designed for mission-critical environments
-Reduced risk of damage to critical equipment
Technical Specifications:
Inputs & Outputs
-Digital Inputs: 3
-Analog Input: 1
-PWM / 1-Wire Output: Supports temperature sensors
-Phoenix Connector: Water leakage sensor connection
Communication
-Protocol: Modbus RTU
-Communication Port: RJ45
-Address Range: 1 to 127
-Configuration: DIP Switch (ID, Parity, Baud Rate)
Electrical
-Power Supply: 7 to 24 V AC/DC
-Power Consumption: Low-power design
Mechanical
-Enclosure: Metal with anti-static powder coating
-Dimensions: 2.5 × 5.1 × 7.4 cm
-Installation: No rack mounting required; installable in any location
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------'),
  ('فن تدبیر سبز ویرا', 'ftsv.ir', 'info@ftsv.ir', 'سنسورهای دما و رطوبت', NULL, 'Temperature & Humidity Sensors', 'سنسورهای دما و رطوبت سری S3 و S4 تولیدی شرکت فرین‌تک، تجهیزات اندازه‌گیری دقیق و قابل‌اعتماد برای پایش شرایط محیطی در کاربردهای صنعتی، ساختمانی و مراکز داده هستند. این سنسورها با بهره‌گیری از حسگرهای باکیفیت شرکت Sensirion و طراحی صنعتی مقاوم، داده‌های پایدار و دقیقی را در بازه وسیعی از شرایط محیطی ارائه می‌دهند و نقش کلیدی در بهینه‌سازی کنترل محیطی و افزایش پایداری تجهیزات حیاتی ایفا می‌کنند.
طراحی ماژولار، پشتیبانی از پروتکل‌های صنعتی متنوع و سازگاری کامل با سیستم‌های DCIM و BMS، این سنسورها را به گزینه‌ای ایده‌آل برای پروژه‌های کوچک تا بسیار بزرگ تبدیل کرده است.
