وضعیت تجاری‌سازی محصول
هم‌اکنون این محصول به صورت تجاری به فروش رسیده است و قابلیت ارایه به مصرف کنندگان گرامی را دارا می‌باشد.', 'In high-altitude orbiting satellites, dish antennas are used instead of rod antennas and small arrays. The conditions outside the satellite at an altitude of 36,000 kilometers with cosmic radiation, high-energy rays, very wide temperature cycles, and almost zero air pressure are some of the cases that require special requirements for the design and construction of a telecommunications antenna. Engineering and qualification samples of this antenna, which have been designed, manufactured and tested in the company in a shaped surface form, have been made available to various teams as a commercial product. Due to the limitations of the test equipment and the three-dimensional radiation pattern, the test sample of the shaped antenna could not be performed in conventional test centers, and therefore the test equipment and infrastructure were developed for this purpose. This antenna is capable of illuminating the surroundings of Iran with a specific pattern. Mechanical equipment; The antenna''s thermal design and mechanical analysis are all done in-house, and the company has the ability to manufacture similar samples tailored to customer needs with high quality.
Features and Advantages:
The selection of its materials was based on the harsh conditions of the outer atmosphere. In the design of this structure, dimensional changes due to temperature changes at different times of the day and night were observed. To design this antenna with a given shape, software has been developed, through which desired radiation patterns can be designed and implemented.
Technical Specifications:
(Maximum 100 words)
The designed frequency band is in the range of 12GHz and the sample weight is 3.9 kg with a reinforced structure and is made as an integrated unit. Thermal and static analyses and simulations have been performed with ABAQUS, ADAMS, Nastran/Patran and Thermal Desktop software and its radiation efficiency is 65% according to the test results.
