وضعیت تجاری‌سازی محصول
هم‌اکنون این محصول به صورت تجاری به فروش رسیده است و قابلیت ارایه به مصرف کنندگان گرامی را دارا می‌باشد.', 'One of the most widely used materials used in various industries such as stone, wood, leather and specialized industries such as composites are adhesives. The structure of the adhesive formulation is optimized according to their specific application, improving them for use in different conditions. By studying and investigating various structures of epoxy-based adhesives, Pishgaman Company has succeeded in formulating an adhesive with high flexibility for use in connecting components that are under vibration. The design team''s goal was to compete with the well-known Araldite 2015 adhesive and introduce a product to replace it, the manufactured sample being superior to the target sample in terms of strength and maximum flexibility during tensile test.
Features and Advantages:
Some of the most prominent features of the designed and manufactured materials are as follows:
• High flowability to fill the pores of the connecting components such as leather, wood and stone surfaces
• High strength
• Ease of use
• Durability of more than two years
• High flexibility and greater vibration absorption
• Reduced vibration of the connecting components compared to bonding with similar adhesives
